Filter list attribution

This application can download and apply community filter lists. Those lists
are not part of the Apache-2.0 grant for the app source.

- EasyList and EasyPrivacy: EasyList community, https://easylist.to/
- Peter Lowe's Ad and tracking server list: https://pgl.yoyo.org/adservers/
- AdGuard Mobile Ads and Tracking Protection: AdGuard, https://adguard.com/en/filters.html

Bundled seed lists in app/src/main/assets/filters are maintained with this
repository so blocking still works before the first update.
